menuconfig MODULES_CC_SAFETY_MONITOR
	bool "cc_safety_monitor"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable support for cc_safety_monitor — the CCFC fork's deterministic
		companion safety policy core (spec §4.5). Consumes validated
		cc_health_report, runs the companion state machine + policy table, and
		issues at most one conservative Hold/Land/RTL / exit-Offboard
		vehicle_command per state transition. Parameterized via CC_MON_*.
